{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_1","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"◎乐下","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_2","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"○宗庙乐歌殿庭乐歌鼓吹导引曲采茨曲","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_3","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"禘祫亲飨，皇帝入门。宫县无射宫《昌宁之曲》：(出、入步武同。)","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_4","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"惟时升平，礼仪肇兴。鸣銮至止，穆穆造庭。百辟卿士，恪谨迎承。恭款祖考，神宇攸宁。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_5","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝升殿，登歌夹钟宫《昌宁之曲》：(升阶及将还板位，皆同登歌。)","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_6","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"笙镛既陈，罍樽在户。升降有容，惟规惟矩。恭敬明神，上仪交举。永言保之，承天之祜。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_7","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝盥洗，宫县无射宫《昌宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_8","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"惟水之功，洁净精微。洗爵奠斝，于德有辉。皇皇穆穆，宗庙之威。宜其感格，福祉交归。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_9","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝降阶，宫县无射宫《昌宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_10","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"于皇神宫，象天清明。有来肃肃，相维公卿。礼仪卒度，君子攸宁。孔时孔惠，绥我思成。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_11","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"迎神，宫县《来宁之曲》。黄钟宫三奏，大吕角二奏，大蔟徵二奏，应钟羽二奏，词同：","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_12","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"八音克谐，百礼具举。明德维清，至诚永慕。神之格思，云軿风驭。来止来临，千祀燕处。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_13","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"司徒引俎，宫县无射宫《丰宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_14","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"维牲维牺，齐明致祠。我将我享，吉蠲奉之。博硕肥腯，神嗜为宜。千秋歆此，永绥黔黎。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_15","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"始祖酌献，宫县无射宫《大元之曲》：","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_16","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"惟酒既清，惟肴既馨。苾芬孝祀，在庙之庭。羞于皇祖，来燕来宁。象功昭德，先祖是听。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_17","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"德皇帝，《大熙之曲》：","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_18","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"万方欣戴，鸿业创基。瑶源垂裕，绵瓞重熙。式崇毖祀，爰考成规。笾豆有楚，益臻皇仪。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_19","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"安皇帝，《大安之曲》：","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_20","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"爰图造邦，载德其昌。皇仪允穆，诞集嘉祥。明诚昭格，积厚流光。祇严清庙，钟石琅琅。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_21","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"献祖，《大昭之曲》：","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_22","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"惟圣兴邦，经始之初。鸠民化俗，还定攸居。迪德纯俭，志规远图。时哉显祀，精诚有孚。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_23","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"昭祖，《大成之曲》：","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_24","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"天启璇源，贻庆定基。率义为勇，施德为威。耀武拓境，功烈巍巍。永昌皇祚，均福黔黎。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_25","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"景祖，《大昌之曲》：","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_26","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"丕显鸿烈，基绪降昌。圣期诞集，邦宇斯张。尊严庙祏，昭格休祥。煌煌缛典，亿载弥光。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_27","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"世祖，《大武之曲》：","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_28","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"桓桓伐功，天监其明。惟威震叠，惟德绥宁。神策无遗，鸿图以兴。会孙孝祀，遹昭厥成。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_29","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"肃宗，《大明之曲》：","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_30","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"于皇神人，武烈文谟。左右世祖，怀柔扫除。威震遐迩，化渐虫鱼。垂光绵永，成帝之孚。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_31","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"穆宗，《大章之曲》：","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_32","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"烝哉文祖，钦圣弘渊。慈爱忠信，典策昭然。歆此明祀，繁祉绵绵。时纯熙矣，流庆万年。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_33","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"康宗，《大康之曲》：","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_34","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"惟明惟听，晔晔神功。仪刑世业，昭格上穹。持盈孝孙，荐芳斯丰。锡我祉福，皇化益隆。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_35","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"太祖，《大定之曲》：","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_36","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"功超殷周，德配唐虞。天人协应，平统寰区。开祥垂裕，肇基永图。明明天子，敬承典谟。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_37","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"太宗，《大惠之曲》：","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_38","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"巍巍德鸿，无为端扆。祚承神功，究驯俗美。清宫缉熙，孝毖时祀。钦奠羞诚，牺樽嘉旨。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_39","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"熙宗《大同之曲》：","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_40","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"昭显令德，神基丕承。对越在天，享用跻升。于穆清庙，来燕来宁。神其醉止，惟钦克诚。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_41","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"睿宗，《大和之曲》：","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_42","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇祖开基，周武殷汤。猗欤圣考，嗣德弥光。启佑洪绪，长发其祥。严恭庙享，万世烝尝。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_43","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"世宗，《大钧之曲》：","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_44","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"神之来思，甫登于堂。稞圭有瓒，秬鬯芬芳。巍巍先功，启祐无疆。万年肆祀，孝心不忘。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_45","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"显宗，《大宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_46","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"于皇神宫，有严惟清。吉蠲孝祀，惟神之宁。对越在天，绥我思诚。敷祐亿年，邦家之庆。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_47","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"章宗，《大隆之典》：","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_48","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"两纪践阼，万方宁康。文经天地，武服遐荒。礼备制定，德隆业昌。居歆典祀，亿载无疆。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_49","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"宣宗，《大庆之曲》：","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_50","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"猗欤圣皇，三代之英。功光先后，德被群生。牲粢惟馨，鼓钟其铿。神兮来思，歆于克诚。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_51","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"文舞退，武舞进，宫县无射宫《肃宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_52","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"明明先皇，神武维扬。开基垂统，万世无疆。干戚象功，威仪有光。神保是飨，昭哉降康。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_53","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"亚终献，无射宫《肃宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_54","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"涓辰之休，昭祀惟恭。威仪陟降，惟礼是从。笾豆静嘉，于论鼓钟。惟皇受祉，监斯德容。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_55","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝饮福，登歌夹钟宫《福宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_56","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"牺牲充洁，粢盛馨香。来格来享，精神用彰。饮此纯禧，简简穰穰。文明天子，万寿无疆。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_57","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"彻豆，登歌夹钟宫《丰宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_58","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"孝祀肃睦，明德以荐。乐奏九成，礼终三献。百辟卿士，进彻以时。小大稽首，神保聿归。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_59","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"送神，宫县黄钟宫《来宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_60","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"洁兹牛羊，清兹酒醴。三献攸终，神既燕喜。神之去兮，载锡繁祉。万寿无疆，永保禋祀。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_61","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"郊祀前，朝享太庙乐歌。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_62","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝入门，宫县无射宫《昌宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_63","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"郊将升禋，庙当告虔。锡銮戾止，孝实奉先。祀事斯举，有序无愆。祗见祖考，神意欢然。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_64","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝升殿，登歌夹钟宫《昌宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_65","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇皇天子，升自阼阶。奠见祖祢，肃然有怀。百礼已洽，八音克谐。既昌且宁，万福沓来。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_66","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"迎神，宫县《来宁之曲》。黄钟宫三奏，大吕角二奏，太蔟徵二奏，应钟羽二奏，词同：","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_67","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"以实应天，报本反始。洁粢丰盛，礼先肆祀。风马云车，神之吊矣。来止来宜，而燕翼子。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_68","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝盥洗，宫县无射宫《昌宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_69","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"有水于罍，有巾于篚。帨手拭爵，圭衮有炜。玄酒大羹，德磬维菲。万年昌宁，皇皇负扆。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_70","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝升阶，宫县无射宫《昌宁之曲》：(降阶，同。)","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_71","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"巍巍京师，有严神宫。圣主戾止，多士云从。来享来献，肃肃其容。将昭大报，庸示推崇。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_72","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"司徒奉俎，宫县无射宫《丰宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_73","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"陈其牺牲，惟纯与精。苾芬孝祀，于昭克诚。不疾瘯蠡，或剥或亨。洋洋在上，以交神明。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_74","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"始祖酌献，宫县《大元之曲》：","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_75","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"猗欤初基，兆我王迹。其命维新，贻谋丕赫。绵绵瓜瓞，国步日辟。堂构之成，焜煌今昔。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_76","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"献祖，《大昭之曲》：","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_77","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"以圣继兴，成王之孚。民从其化，咸奠攸居。清庙观德，猗欤伟欤。金石备乐，以奉神娱。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_78","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"昭祖，《大成之曲》：","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_79","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"东夷不庭，皇祖震怒。神武削平，贻厥圣绪。犹室有基，垣墉乃树。亿万斯年，天保孔固。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_80","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"景祖，《大昌之曲》：","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_81","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"于皇艺祖，其智如神。修法施令，百度惟新。疆宇日广，海隅咸宾。功高德厚，耀耀震震。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_82","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"世祖，《大武之曲》：","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_83","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"于皇先王，昭假于天。长驾远驭，麾斥无前。王业犹生，孙谋有传。圆坛展礼，敢先告虔。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_84","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"肃宗，《大明之曲》：","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_85","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"猗欤前人，简惠昭融。相我世祖，成兹伐功。敷佑来叶，帝图其隆。将修熙事，先款神宫。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_86","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"穆宗，《大章之曲》：","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_87","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"仁慈忠信，惟祖之休。功光岐下，迹掩商丘。言瞻清庙，怀想前修。神其来格，歆兹庶羞。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_88","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"康宗，《大康之曲》：","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_89","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"猗欤前王，惠我无疆。仪刑典法，日靖四方。永言孝思，于乎不忘。昭告大祀，祗率旧章。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_90","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"太祖，《大定之曲》：","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_91","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"天生聪明，俾乂蒸人。惟此二国，为我驱民。挞彼威武，万邦咸宾。明昭大报，推而配神。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_92","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"太宗，《大惠之曲》：","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_93","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"维清缉熙，于昭明德。我其收之，骏奔万国。南郊肇修，大典增饰。清庙吉蠲，纯禧申锡。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_94","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"睿宗，《大和之曲》：","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_95","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"维时祖功，肇开神基。昭哉圣考，其德增辉。上动天监，明命攸归。谋贻翼子，无疆之辞。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_96","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"文舞退，武舞进，宫县《肃宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_97","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"先皇开基，比迹殷汤，功加天下，武德弥光。容舞象成，干戈戚扬。于昭报本，怀哉不忘。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_98","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"亚终献，宫县《肃宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_99","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"于皇宗祊，朝献维时。芬芬酒醴，棣棣威仪。诚则有余，神之格思。神孙千亿，神其相之。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_100","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝饮福，登歌夹钟宫《福宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_101","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇皇穆穆，丕承丕基。躬亲于禋，载肃载祗。对越在天，神歆其诚。于以饮酒，如川之增。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_102","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"彻豆，登歌夹钟宫《丰宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_103","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"物维其时，既丰且旨。苾苾德馨，或将或肆。神之居歆，洽于百礼。于万斯年，穰穰介祉。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_104","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"送神，宫县黄钟宫《来宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_105","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"济济多仪，皇皇雅奏。献终反爵，荐余彻豆。神监昭回，有秩斯祐。无疆之福，申锡厥后。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_106","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"昭德皇后别庙，郊祀前荐享，登歌乐曲。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_107","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"初献盥洗，夷则宫《肃宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_108","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"神无常享，时歆精诚。惟诚惟洁，感通神明。先事盥涤，注兹清冷。巾篚既奠，尊彝荐馨。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_109","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"初献升、降殿，中吕宫《嘉宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_110","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"有来肃肃，登降以敬。粲粲袨服，锵锵佩声。金石节奏，既协且平。其仪不忒，乃终有庆。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_111","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"司徒奉俎，奏夷则宫《丰宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_112","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"馨我黍稷，洁我牲牷。降升有节，荐是吉蠲。工祝致告，威仪肃然。神之吊矣，元吉其旋。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_113","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"酌献，奏夷则宫《仪坤之曲》：","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_114","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"伣天之妹，坤德利贞。圆丘有事，先荐以诚。我酒既旨，我肴既盈。神其居飨，福禄来成。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_115","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"彻豆，奏中吕宫《丰宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_116","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"明昭祀事，旧典无违。乐既云阕，神其聿归。礼之克成，神保斯飨。于万斯年，迓续丕贶。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_117","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"祫禘有司摄事。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_118","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"初献盥洗，宫县无射宫《肃宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_119","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"祀事之大，齐栗为先。洁精以献，沃盥于前。既灌以升，乃荐豆笾。神其感格，歆于吉蠲。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_120","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"升自西阶，登歌奏夹钟宫《嘉宁之曲》：(余并同亲祀。)","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_121","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"国有太宫，合食以礼。跻阶肃肃，降陛济济。锵然纯音，节乃容止。神之格思，永绥福履。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_122","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"时享，摄事登歌乐章。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_123","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"初献盥洗，无射宫《肃宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_124","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"酌彼行潦，维挹其请。洁齐以祀，祀事昭明。显允辟公，沃盥乃升。神之至止，歆于克诚。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_125","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"初献升殿，夹钟宫《嘉宁之曲》：(余同亲祀，惟不用宫县。)","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_126","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"济济在庭，祗荐有序。雍容令仪，旋规折矩。爰徂于基，鸣佩接武。敬恭神明，来宁来处。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_127","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"昭德皇后时享，登歌乐章。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_128","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"初献盥洗，无射宫《肃宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_129","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"时祀有章，礼备乐举。爰洁其盥，亦丰其俎。俯仰升降，中规中矩。神其来格，百神是与。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_130","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"初献升殿，夹钟宫《嘉宁之曲》：(三献及司徒降，同。)","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_131","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"假哉神宫，神宫有侐。惟时吉蠲，登降翼翼。歌钟锵煌，笙磬翕绎。于昭肃恭，灵釐来格。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_132","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"司徒奉俎，无射宫《丰宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_133","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"宫庭枚枚，钟磬喤喤。既仪圭鬯，既奠惣芗。齐庄奉馈，笾豆大房。灵之右飨，流庆无疆。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_134","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"酌献，无射宫《仪坤之曲》：","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_135","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"于皇坤德，作合乾仪。涂山懿范，京室芳徽，容声如在，典祀惟时。神其克享，荐祉来宜。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_136","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"亚终献，无射宫《仪坤之曲》：","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_137","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"嘉羞实俎，高张在庭。申献合礼(终献改申为三)，坤德仪刑。神其是听，用鬯清明。清明既鬯，来享来宁。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_138","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"彻豆，夹钟宫《丰宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_139","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"礼成于终，神心禗禗。惣萧发馨，乐阙献已。徒驭孔多，灵舆载轙。青玄悠悠，归且亿矣。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_140","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"宣孝太子别庙，登歌乐章。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_141","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"初献升殿，夹钟宫《承安之曲》：","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_142","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"有腯斯牲，有馨斯齐。美哉洋洋，升降以礼。礼容既庄，乐亦谐止。神之格思，式歆明祀。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_143","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"酌献，无射宫《和宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_144","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"于惟光灵，孝德昭宣。高丽有奕，来宁来燕。于荐惟祫，既时既蠲。从我烈祖，载享亿年。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_145","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"亚终献，《和宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_146","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"金石和奏，豆笾惟丰。祠宫奉事，齐敬精衷。笙吟伊浦，鹤驻缑峰。是保是飨，灵德无穷。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_147","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"彻豆，夹钟宫《和安之曲》：","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_148","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"寝成奕奕，今兹其时。明称肇祀，将礼之仪。侯安以怿，羞嘉且时。乐阕献已，神其飨思。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_149","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大定三年十月，追上睿宗册宝，应钟宫《显宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_150","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"天开休运。积仁而昌。命兹昭考，敢忘显扬。上仪肇举，涓日之良。来格来享，惠我无疆。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_151","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大定十九年，升祔熙宗册宝乐曲：","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_152","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"恢大帝业，敉宁多方。懿德茂烈，金书发扬。肇举上仪，涓择吉日。鸿名赫赫，与天无极。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_153","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"上册宝，宫县《静宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_154","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"日卜其吉，承祀孔肃。广号追崇，孝心克笃。于乎悠哉，来思晬穆。宝册既陈，委于宗祝。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_155","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇帝降殿，宫县《鸿宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_156","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"继世隆昌，临朝静默。追谥鸿名，发辉潜德。玉质金章，煌煌简册。涓辰展仪，永传无极。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_157","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"殿庭乐歌。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_158","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大定七年正月，上册宝，皇帝将升御座，宫县奏太蔟宫《泰宁之曲》：(降座，同。)","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_159","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"德隆帝位，承天而兴。侯邦来庭，民居安宁。归美以报，传之无极。鸿名徽称，寿时万亿。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_160","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"册宝入门，奏《天保报上之曲》：","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_161","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"四方既平，功归圣明。定功巍巍，丕享鸿名。股肱良哉，揄扬元首。储精优游，南山等寿。","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_162","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"奉册宝官将复班位，奏《归美扬功之曲》：","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_163","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"圣德高明，万邦咸休。锱铢唐虞，糠骰商周。维时群臣，对扬稽首。天子明明，令闻不朽。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_164","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"册宝初行，奏《和宁之曲》：(册宝将升殿，皇太子自侍立位至降阶，曲并同。)","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_165","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"四方攸同，昭哉成功。时和年丰，诸福来崇。英声昭腾，和气充塞。于乎皇王，维寿时亿。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_166","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇太子升殿贺，奏《同心戴圣之曲》：","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_167","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"穆清皇风，遐方来同。于昭于天，物和岁丰。丕受鸿名，对扬伟迹。纯厘穰穰，敷锡罔极。","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_168","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"上寿，皇帝将升御座，宫县《和宁之曲》。(同前。)","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_169","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"举酒，《万寿无疆之曲》：","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_170","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"四海太平，吾皇之功。群臣对扬，诞受鸿名。霞觞琼腴，君王乐岂。皇天垂休，万寿无极。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_171","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇太子升阶、降阶，及与宴官升殿，并奏《和宁之曲》。(同前。)","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_172","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"进第一爵，登歌奏《王道昌明之曲》：","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_173","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"对天鸿休，于以铺张。巍巍煌煌，超冠百王。皇图皇纲，时维明昌。祉福无疆，于民敷扬。","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_174","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"行群官酒，宫县《和宁之曲》。文舞入，设群官食，奏《功成治定之舞》，三成止：","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_175","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"圣德高明，如天强名。多方治平，功大有成。流于声音，形于蹈舞。颁觞群臣。以昭礼遇。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_176","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"进第二爵，登歌奏《天子万年之曲》：","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_177","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"惟明后，驭寰瀛。跻升平，飞英声。功三王，德五帝。游岩廊，亿万岁。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_178","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"行群官酒，宫县《和宁之曲》。武舞入，设群官食，奏《四海会同之舞》，三成止：","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_179","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"地平天成，时和岁丰。迓衡弗迷，率惟敉功。受天之祜，四方来荷。于万斯年，不遐有佐。","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_180","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"进第三爵，登歌《嘉禾之曲》：","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_181","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"景命赫斯归吾皇，仁风洋洋被远荒。琛贽旅庭趋明光，气和薰蒸为嘉祥。殊本合穗真异常，庾如坻京岁且穰。猗欤鸿休超前王，播为声诗传无疆。(行群官酒、设群官食、群官降阶，宫县并奏《和宁之曲》，皇帝将降御座，奏《泰宁之曲》，并用太簇宫。)","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_182","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大定十一年十一月，行册礼，皇帝升御座，宫县《泰宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_183","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇皇穆穆，衮服玉趾，如日之升，如山仰止。九宾在列，媚兹天子。愿言无疆，介以繁祉。","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_184","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"册宝入门，奏《天保报上之曲》：","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_185","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"穆穆元圣，天迪子保。相维臣工，以奏丕号。扬于路朝，玉牒神宝。于万斯年，吾君寿考。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_186","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"奉册宝官将复班位，奏《归美扬功之曲》：","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_187","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"玉册玉宝，尊圣天子，丕扬鸿名，昭受帝祉。闳休对天，其隆孰比。臣下同心，翼戴归美。","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_188","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇太子升殿贺，奏《同心戴圣之曲》：","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_189","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大矣我后，徽册膺受。欢趋彤庭，拜手稽首。休明御辰，无疆万寿。灵贶沓来，天地长久。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_190","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"举酒，奏《万寿无疆之曲》：","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_191","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"圣德懋昭，民归天祐。煌煌金书，典册光受。备乐在庭，八音谐奏。群公奉觞，天子万寿。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_192","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"进第一爵，登歌《王道昌明之曲》：","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_193","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"明明我皇，道光化溥。百度惟新，礼修乐举。藻饰太平，烂然可睹。超跻三王，晖映千古。","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_194","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"设群官食，奏《和宁之曲》、《功成治定之舞》：","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_195","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"穆穆我君，威折群丑。辉光日新，仁洽九有。容典葳蕤，超前绝后。端拱深严，宝册膺受。","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_196","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"第二爵，登歌奏《天子万年之曲》：","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_197","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"典礼修，惟明后。扬鸿名，灿琼玖。罗华绅，为万寿。歌南山，坚且久。","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_198","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"行群官酒，奏《和宁之曲》、《四海会同之舞》：","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_199","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"道隆政平，天开有德。万国和宁，来王来极。昭受鸿名，俯徇列辟。锡饮行觞，欢心各得。","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_200","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"第三爵，登歌奏《嘉禾之曲》：","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_201","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"众瑞毕至昭升平，爰生嘉禾乃合穗。膴膴大田无南东，稼茂如云成丰岁。既刈既获百室盈，击壤歌沸野老声。陶唐之民兹其比，帝力何有若自遂。","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_202","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大定十八年十二月，上受命宝，皇帝将升御座，宫县奏《泰宁之曲》。并大吕宫：","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_203","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"上帝有赫，怀此明德。畀之神宝，庸镇万国。临轩是膺，登降维则。群臣拜首，年卜万亿。","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_204","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"宝入门，奏《天保报上之曲》：","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_205","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"受命大宝，昭答眷佑。珍符明贶，人为天授。文物具举，《韶》、《濩》迭奏。群臣上之，天子万寿。","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_206","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"群臣合班，奏《归美扬功之曲》：","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_207","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"德冒生民，明明元后。端冕临轩，神宝是受。群工来贺，咸拜稽首。无疆无期，享祚长久。","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_208","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇太子升殿、并自侍立位降阶，宫县《称觞介寿之曲》：","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_209","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"上仪昭举，膺时瑞玉。群辟在列，跄跄肃肃。衮衣桓圭，归美稽首。升降惟时，天子万寿。","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_210","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"举酒，登歌奏《万寿无疆之曲》：","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_211","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"上帝眷命，纯休兹至。诞膺洪宝，光临大器。称觞对扬，嵩岳万岁。其宁惟永，无疆卜世。","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_212","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"天德二年十月，册立中宫，皇帝将升御座，宫县奏《乾宁之曲》：(降座，同。)","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_213","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"人道大伦，王化所基。明圣稽古，阴教欲施。临轩发册，备举彝仪。《麟趾》《关雎》，宜播声诗。","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_214","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"册宝入门，奏《昌宁之曲》：(出门，同。)","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_215","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"羽卫充庭，淑旗徽章。礼仪具举，涓辰以良。相我内训，来仪椒房。亿万斯年，邦家之光。","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_216","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"将受册宝、以册宝入门，宫县奏《肃宁之曲》：(命妇升、降，同。)","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_217","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"涂山兴夏，《关雎》美周。坤仪之尊，母临九州。瑶册祎衣，光配凝旒。地久天长。福禄是遒。","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_218","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"后出阁，奏《顺宁之曲》：(升、降座，同。)","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_219","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"天立厥配，任姒比隆。母仪四海，化行六宫。日月并明，乾坤合德。于万斯年，作俪宸极。","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_220","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"受册，奏《坤宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_221","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"风化之始，由于壶闱。礼文斯备，爰正坤仪。维顺以慈，俪圣同德。则百斯男，垂统无极。","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_222","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"天德四年二月，册皇太子，皇帝将升御座，宫县奏《乾宁之曲》：(皆用夹钟宫。)","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_223","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大君有为，先图本固。涓辰之吉，礼成储副。文物备陈，声乐皆具。人心载宁，克昌福祚。","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_224","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"册使入门，《昌宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_225","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"在天成象，焕乎前星。惟圣时宪，典礼以行。一人有庆，万邦以贞。社稷之福，浸昌浸明。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_226","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇太子入门，奏《元宁之曲》：(出门，同。)","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_227","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇矣上帝，纯佐明圣。笃生元良，日跻德性，册命主器，万邦以正。龙楼问寝，亿年之庆。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_228","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大定八年正月，册皇太子，皇帝将升御座，宫县《洪宁之曲》：(并用太簇宫。)","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_229","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"会朝清明，临轩备礼。天威皇皇，臣工济济。于昭元良，膺兹典册。对扬闳休，卜年万亿。","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_230","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇太子入门，奏《肃宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_231","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"光昭前星，惟天垂象。稽古而行，主器以长。曲礼告成，迩遐属望。国本既隆，繁厘永享。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_232","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"群臣合班，奏《嘉宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_233","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"于皇临轩，礼崇上嗣，维眷之祺，傃方正位。言观其仪，翔翔济济。美归吾君，太平万岁。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_234","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇太子复受册位，奏《和宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_235","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"祖功艰难，经营缔构。基牢根深，枝繁叶茂。于昭贻谋，骈休集佑。元良斯贞，吾皇万寿。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_236","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大定二十七年三月，册皇太孙，皇帝将升御座，宫县《泰宁之曲》：(并姑洗宫。)","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_237","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"上天丛休，申锡祚胤。孙谋有诒，临轩体正。煌煌上仪，欣欣众听。隆我邦本，无疆惟庆。","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_238","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇太孙入门，奏《庆宁之曲》：(出门，同。)","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_239","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"宝源流光，流光惟远。孙谋有贻，庆序昭衍。于乐众望，于皇备典。动容周旋，承兹嘉羡。","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_240","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"群臣合班，奏《顺宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_241","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"冕旒当宁，徽章备举。彩仗充庭，金石列虡，济济多士，翼翼就序。海润山晖，倾听乐府。","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_242","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"皇太孙复受册位，奏《保宁之曲》：","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_243","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"礼之攸闻，丕建世嫡。众论协从，天心不易。名崇震宫，辞著瑞册。社稷宗庙，无疆夷怿。","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_244","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"鼓吹导引曲","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_245","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"天眷三年九月，驾幸燕京，导引曲：(无射宫。)","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_246","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"五年一狩，仙仗到人间，问稼穑艰难。苍生洗眼秋光里，今日见天颜。金戈玉斧临香火，驰道六龙闲。歌谣到处皆相似，天子寿南山。","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_247","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"天德二年三月，祫享回銮，导引曲：","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_248","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"礼成庙享，御卫拱飞龙，诸道起祥风。太平天子多受福，孝德与天通。凤箫龙管《韶》音奏，声在五云中。粲然文物昭治世，万亿祀无穷。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_249","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"贞元元年三月，驾幸中都，导引曲：(并姑洗宫。)","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_250","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"銮舆顺动，嘉气满神京，辇路宿尘清。钩陈万旅随天仗，缥缈转霓旌。都人望幸倾尧日，鳌扑溢欢声。临观八极辰居正，寰宇庆升平。","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_251","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"《采茨曲》：","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_252","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"新都春色满，华盖定全燕。时运千龄协，星辰五纬连。六龙承晓日，丹凤倚中天。王气盘山海，皇居亿万年。","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_253","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"贞元三年十一月，祫享回銮，《采茨曲》：(并用。)","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_254","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"庆成回大驾，仙仗紫云深。龙衮辉千骑，嵩呼间八音。太平兴缛礼，万国得欢心。孝格迎遐福，穰穰永降临。","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_255","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"正隆六年六月，驾幸南京，导引曲：(并林钟宫。)","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_256","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"神宫壮丽，宫殿压蓬莱，向晓九门开。圣明天子初巡幸，遥驾六龙来。五云影里排仙仗，清跸绝纤埃。都人齐唱升平曲，更进万年杯。","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_257","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"《采茨曲》：","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_258","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"双阙层云表，澄景开清晓。六龙天上来，驰道平如扫。虞巡五载合，夏谚一游同。都人欣豫意，写入颂声中。","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_259","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大定三年十月，祫享回銮，《采茨》、导引曲：(皆应钟宫。自后亲祀，二曲并用。)","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_260","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"太宫崇烈考，大礼庆初成。彩仗回云步，天阶严跸声。舜宫合至孝，周《颂》咏维清。介福应穰简，欢交万国情。","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_261","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"导引曲：","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_262","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"礼行清庙，华黍荐年丰，圣孝与天通。六龙回驭千官卫，玉振珮环风。黄麾金辂严天仗，非雾郁葱葱。工歌叠奏升平曲，福禄自来崇。","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_263","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"大定二十七年三月，皇太孙受册，谢庙，导引曲：","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_40_264","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_40","textTraditional":"璇源浚发，衍庆自灵长，圣运日隆昌。震闱显册遵彝典，基绪焕重光。练时庙见严昭报，礼乐粲成章。精诚潜格神明助，福禄永无疆。","sentenceOrder":264}],"overrides":{}}